        "created_at": "2012-04-24T14:15:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Basically, at the beginning of the turn, you do anything that says at the start of the villain turn. In Omnitron’s case, you flip his cards (but only once).  Then you simply play a card.  After that, you do anything that says at the end of the villain turn.  In Omnitron’s case, that is either play another card, or reveal from the trash, depending on which side he is on.</p>",
