        "id": 28993,
        "name": "The Conscience",
        "username": "The_Conscience",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/58956e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-04-24T14:16:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If a card from the Environment or Villain deck is played during the play step of the turn, it takes effect during the current turn unless it is a start of turn effect, then it will take effect the next turn, as it was not in play at the start of the Environment/Villain turn.</p>\n<p>Example:<br>\nStart of Environment turn: Do all Start of turn effects on Environment cards in play.<br>\nPlay an Environment card from the top of the Environment deck.<br>\nEnd of Environment turn: Do all End of turn effects on Environment cards in play.</p>\n<p>Also all effects should happen in the order in which they were played (at least that’s how we play it).</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:02:56.596Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
