        "id": 28995,
        "name": "TheJayMann",
        "username": "TheJayMann",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-04-24T14:29:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Basically, you do read and follow all text when the card comes into play.  However, “At the start of the environment turn, this card deals the 2 targets with the highest HP 5 melee damage each,” actually sets up a trigger.  The inner effect is then only caused by the start of environment event.  You still follow all directions on the card, it’s just the directions set up a trigger rather than have any actual effect.  Also, Omnitron and Megalopolis are of the easiest setups, thus explaining why you seem to have lack of a challenge.</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:02:56.770Z",
