        "created_at": "2012-04-24T14:40:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thanks guys for the clarifications and letting us know the difficulty of that particular combo.  At PAX we played vs the rat man in the land time forgot dinosaur island and got creamed so I thought I was doing something wrong <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\">  Can’t wait to keep playing!  Already a kickstart backer of the next expansion too!</p>\n<p>-Will</p>",
